{
	"$schema": "http://127.0.0.1:5186/schema/registry-item.json",
	"name": "button",
	"title": "Button 按钮",
	"type": "registry:ui",
	"description": "触发一个操作或跳转，是界面里最常见的可点击元素。",
	"devDependencies": [
		"tailwind-variants@^3.3.0"
	],
	"meta": {
		"valar": {
			"keywords": [
				"按钮",
				"button",
				"提交",
				"CTA",
				"操作",
				"点击"
			],
			"whenToUse": [
				"提交表单、确认、保存等明确操作",
				"需要像按钮一样的链接（传 href）"
			],
			"whenNotToUse": [
				{
					"case": "在一组互斥选项间切换",
					"use": "toggle-group"
				},
				{
					"case": "开关某个设置",
					"use": "switch"
				},
				{
					"case": "一行内的纯文字链接"
				}
			],
			"accessibility": [
				"只有图标时必须加 aria-label",
				"禁用时用 disabled，不要只改颜色"
			],
			"responsive": [
				"触屏场景至少使用 default 尺寸，避免误触",
				"窄屏下主操作可占满整行"
			],
			"related": [
				"button-group",
				"toggle",
				"alert-dialog"
			]
		}
	},
	"files": [
		{
			"content": "# Button 设计规范\n\n- 一个区域（卡片、弹窗底部、表单）最多一个 `variant=\"default\"` 实心主按钮；其余操作用 `outline`、`secondary` 或 `ghost`。\n- 不可撤销的危险操作用 `variant=\"destructive\"`，并先用 Alert Dialog 确认。\n- 尺寸只用 `size` 属性（`xs`、`sm`、`default`、`lg`，图标按钮用 `icon`、`icon-sm` 等）；不要用 `class` 写高度、内边距或圆角（检查规则 `valar/button-size-via-prop`）。\n- 只有图标的按钮必须有 `aria-label`（检查规则 `valar/icon-button-label`）。\n- 紧凑工具栏的图标按钮使用 `size=\"icon-sm\"`。按钮为 28 × 28 px，图标默认 14 × 14 px。边框色、底色、文字色和透明度使用 150 ms 过渡，系统启用减少动态效果时即时切换。\n- 常规工作区操作采用 32 px 高、13 px／500 字重和 12 px 横向内边距，Issue 底部紧凑按钮采用 28 px 高、12 px／500 字重和 10 px 横向内边距。独立文字按钮在各视觉变体中默认使用胶囊形。深色工作区按钮即时切换颜色。键盘焦点使用内侧提示。\n- `disabled` 用于不可用操作。异步操作设置 `loading`，以保留键盘焦点、阻止重复触发并传达忙碌状态，可搭配带 `data-icon` 的 Spinner 和状态文字。基础预览的等待与完成行为使用本地数据。\n- 主按钮和危险按钮使用工作区蓝紫色和实心危险色，描边按钮使用独立表面，幽灵按钮在悬停或选中时显示底色。需要局部主题覆盖时用 `--valar-button-primary`、`--valar-button-primary-hover`、`--valar-button-outline` 等组件变量。\n- 跳转用 `href`，不要在按钮里再包一个链接；表单提交用 `type=\"submit\"`。\n- 不要用原生 `<button>` 或自己写样式的元素冒充按钮（检查规则 `valar/use-button-component`）。\n- 独立文字按钮需要主题圆角矩形时用 `shape=\"square\"`。图标按钮默认使用主题圆角，传入 `shape=\"pill\"` 时为圆形。\n- 同心圆角：按钮放进有圆角的容器时，按钮圆角约等于容器圆角减去两者间距；圆形和胶囊按钮不得顶出容器的圆角。在 ButtonGroup 内圆角由按钮组决定，`shape` 不生效。\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "button/RULES.md"
		},
		{
			"content": "<script lang=\"ts\" module>\n\timport { type VariantProps, tv } from \"tailwind-variants\";\n\timport { cn, type WithElementRef } from \"$UTILS$.js\";\n\timport type { HTMLAnchorAttributes, HTMLButtonAttributes } from \"svelte/elements\";\n\n\texport const buttonVariants = tv({\n\t\tbase: \"[--valar-button-ink-base:lch(19.588%_1.25_282)] [--valar-button-hover-ink-base:lch(9.794%_0_282)] [--valar-button-focus-base:lch(53%_52.26_286.91)] [--valar-button-hover-base:lch(94.854%_.5_282)] [--valar-button-surface-shadow-base:0_3px_6px_-2px_rgb(0_0_0/.02),0_1px_1px_rgb(0_0_0/.04)] dark:[--valar-button-ink-base:lch(90.451%_1.2_272)] dark:[--valar-button-hover-ink-base:white] dark:[--valar-button-focus-base:lch(47.918%_59.303_288.421)] dark:[--valar-button-hover-base:lch(18.634%_1.075_272)] dark:[--valar-button-surface-shadow-base:0_0.5px_1px_1px_rgb(0_0_0/.30)] rounded-lg border-[0.5px] border-transparent bg-clip-padding text-[13px]/[normal] font-medium transition-[border-color,background-color,color,opacity] duration-150 ease-out dark:duration-0 motion-reduce:transition-none [&_svg:not([class*='size-'])]:size-4 motion-reduce:[&_[data-slot=spinner]]:animate-none focus-visible:border-[color:var(--valar-button-focus,var(--valar-button-focus-base))] focus-visible:ring-[color:var(--valar-button-focus,var(--valar-button-focus-base))] focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-inset aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-1 aria-invalid:ring-inset aria-invalid:ring-destructive disabled:opacity-60 not-data-loading:aria-disabled:opacity-60 group/button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap outline-none select-none disabled:pointer-events-none [&_svg]:pointer-events-none [&_svg]:shrink-0 [a]:not-data-loading:aria-disabled:pointer-events-none\",\n\t\tvariants: {\n\t\t\tvariant: {\n\t\t\t\tdefault: \"[--valar-button-primary-base:lch(53%_52.26_286.91)] [--valar-button-primary-ink-base:lch(100%_5_286.91)] [--valar-button-primary-hover-base:lch(47%_50.26_286.91)] dark:[--valar-button-primary-base:lch(47.918%_59.303_288.421)] dark:[--valar-button-primary-ink-base:lch(100%_5_288.421)] dark:[--valar-button-primary-hover-base:lch(52.418%_61.103_288.421)] bg-[color:var(--valar-button-primary,var(--valar-button-primary-base))] text-[color:var(--valar-button-primary-ink,var(--valar-button-primary-ink-base))] shadow-(--valar-button-surface-shadow-base) hover:bg-[color:var(--valar-button-primary-hover,var(--valar-button-primary-hover-base))] focus-visible:ring-white\",\n\t\t\t\toutline: \"[--valar-button-outline-base:lch(99.997%_.5_282)] [--valar-button-outline-border-base:rgb(0_0_0/.09)] [--valar-button-outline-hover-base:lch(95.883%_.157_282)] dark:[--valar-button-outline-base:lch(10.149%_.689_272)] dark:[--valar-button-outline-border-base:rgb(255_255_255/.137)] dark:[--valar-button-outline-hover-base:lch(14.777%_1.075_272)] bg-[color:var(--valar-button-outline,var(--valar-button-outline-base))] text-[color:var(--valar-button-ink,var(--valar-button-ink-base))] shadow-[0_0_0_0.5px_var(--valar-button-outline-border-base),var(--valar-button-surface-shadow-base)] hover:bg-[color:var(--valar-button-outline-hover-base)] hover:[--valar-button-outline-border-base:rgb(0_0_0/.15)] dark:hover:[--valar-button-outline-border-base:rgb(255_255_255/.137)] aria-expanded:bg-[color:var(--valar-button-outline-hover-base)] dark:disabled:bg-[lch(17.574%_1.589_272)] dark:disabled:text-[lch(64.805%_1.65_272)]\",\n\t\t\t\tsecondary: \"[--valar-button-secondary-base:lch(94.854%_.5_282)] dark:[--valar-button-secondary-base:lch(18.634%_1.075_272)] bg-[color:var(--valar-button-secondary,var(--valar-button-secondary-base))] text-[color:var(--valar-button-ink,var(--valar-button-ink-base))] hover:bg-[color:color-mix(in_lch,var(--valar-button-secondary,var(--valar-button-secondary-base)),var(--valar-button-hover-ink-base)_5%)] aria-expanded:bg-[color:color-mix(in_lch,var(--valar-button-secondary,var(--valar-button-secondary-base)),var(--valar-button-hover-ink-base)_5%)]\",\n\t\t\t\tghost: \"text-[color:var(--valar-button-ink,var(--valar-button-ink-base))] hover:bg-[color:var(--valar-button-hover-base)] hover:text-[color:var(--valar-button-hover-ink-base)] aria-expanded:bg-[color:var(--valar-button-hover-base)] aria-expanded:text-[color:var(--valar-button-hover-ink-base)] aria-pressed:bg-[color:var(--valar-button-hover-base)] aria-pressed:text-[color:var(--valar-button-hover-ink-base)]\",\n\t\t\t\tdestructive: \"[--valar-button-danger-base:lch(58%_73_29)] [--valar-button-danger-ink-base:lch(100%_5_286.91)] dark:[--valar-button-danger-ink-base:lch(100%_5_288.421)] bg-[color:var(--valar-button-danger,var(--valar-button-danger-base))] text-[color:var(--valar-button-danger-ink,var(--valar-button-danger-ink-base))] shadow-(--valar-button-surface-shadow-base) hover:bg-[color:color-mix(in_lch,var(--valar-button-danger,var(--valar-button-danger-base)),black_5%)] focus-visible:ring-white\",\n\t\t\t\tlink: \"text-[color:var(--valar-button-link,lch(48%_52.26_286.91))] underline-offset-4 hover:underline focus-visible:underline dark:text-[color:var(--valar-button-link,lch(75%_43_288.421))]\",\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t\tsize: {\n\t\t\t\tdefault: \"h-8 gap-1.5 px-3 has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-2 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-2\",\n\t\t\t\txs: \"h-6 gap-1 rounded-[min(var(--radius-md),10px)] px-2 text-xs in-data-[slot=button-group]:rounded-lg has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-1.5 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-1.5 [&_svg:not([class*='size-'])]:size-3\",\n\t\t\t\tsm: \"h-7 gap-1 rounded-[min(var(--radius-md),12px)] px-2.5 text-xs in-data-[slot=button-group]:rounded-lg has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-1.5 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-1.5 [&_svg:not([class*='size-'])]:size-3.5\",\n\t\t\t\tlg: \"h-9 gap-1.5 px-2.5 has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-2 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-2\",\n\t\t\t\ticon: \"size-8\",\n\t\t\t\t\"icon-xs\": \"size-6 rounded-[min(var(--radius-md),10px)] in-data-[slot=button-group]:rounded-lg [&_svg:not([class*='size-'])]:size-3\",\n\t\t\t\t\"icon-sm\": \"size-7 rounded-[min(var(--radius-md),12px)] in-data-[slot=button-group]:rounded-lg [&_svg:not([class*='size-'])]:size-3.5\",\n\t\t\t\t\"icon-lg\": \"size-9\",\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t\tshape: {\n\t\t\t\tauto: \"\",\n\t\t\t\tpill: \"not-in-data-[slot=button-group]:rounded-full\",\n\t\t\t\tsquare: \"\",\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t},\n\t\tcompoundVariants: [\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tshape: \"auto\",\n\t\t\t\tsize: [\"default\", \"xs\", \"sm\", \"lg\"],\n\t\t\t\tclass: \"not-in-data-[slot=button-group]:rounded-full\",\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t],\n\t\tdefaultVariants: {\n\t\t\tvariant: \"default\",\n\t\t\tsize: \"default\",\n\t\t\tshape: \"auto\",\n\t\t},\n\t});\n\n\texport type ButtonVariant = VariantProps<typeof buttonVariants>[\"variant\"];\n\texport type ButtonSize = VariantProps<typeof buttonVariants>[\"size\"];\n\texport type ButtonShape = VariantProps<typeof buttonVariants>[\"shape\"];\n\n\texport type ButtonProps = WithElementRef<HTMLButtonAttributes> &\n\t\tWithElementRef<HTMLAnchorAttributes> & {\n\t\t\tvariant?: ButtonVariant;\n\t\t\tsize?: ButtonSize;\n\t\t\t/** Prevents repeat activation while leaving focus on the pending action. */\n\t\t\tloading?: boolean;\n\t\t\t/** Auto uses a pill for text sizes and the theme radius for icon sizes. */\n\t\t\tshape?: ButtonShape;\n\t\t};\n</script>\n\n<script lang=\"ts\">\n\tlet {\n\t\tclass: className,\n\t\tvariant = \"default\",\n\t\tsize = \"default\",\n\t\tshape = \"auto\",\n\t\tref = $bindable(null),\n\t\thref = undefined,\n\t\ttype = \"button\",\n\t\tdisabled,\n\t\tloading = false,\n\t\ttabindex,\n\t\tchildren,\n\t\t...restProps\n\t}: ButtonProps = $props();\n\n\tfunction blockActivation(event: MouseEvent) {\n\t\tevent.preventDefault();\n\t\tevent.stopPropagation();\n\t}\n</script>\n\n{#if href}\n\t<a\n\t\tbind:this={ref}\n\t\tdata-slot=\"button\"\n\t\tdata-variant={variant}\n\t\tdata-size={size}\n\t\tdata-shape={shape}\n\t\tclass={cn(buttonVariants({ variant, size, shape }), className)}\n\t\t{...restProps}\n\t\thref={disabled || loading ? undefined : href}\n\t\taria-disabled={disabled || loading ? true : restProps[\"aria-disabled\"]}\n\t\taria-busy={loading ? true : restProps[\"aria-busy\"]}\n\t\tdata-loading={loading ? \"\" : undefined}\n\t\trole={disabled || loading ? \"link\" : restProps.role}\n\t\ttabindex={disabled ? -1 : loading ? (tabindex ?? 0) : tabindex}\n\t\tonclick={disabled || loading ? blockActivation : restProps.onclick}\n\t>\n\t\t{@render children?.()}\n\t</a>\n{:else}\n\t<button\n\t\tbind:this={ref}\n\t\tdata-slot=\"button\"\n\t\tdata-variant={variant}\n\t\tdata-size={size}\n\t\tdata-shape={shape}\n\t\tclass={cn(buttonVariants({ variant, size, shape }), className)}\n\t\t{type}\n\t\t{disabled}\n\t\ttabindex={disabled ? -1 : tabindex}\n\t\t{...restProps}\n\t\taria-disabled={loading ? true : restProps[\"aria-disabled\"]}\n\t\taria-busy={loading ? true : restProps[\"aria-busy\"]}\n\t\tdata-loading={loading ? \"\" : undefined}\n\t\tonclick={loading ? blockActivation : restProps.onclick}\n\t>\n\t\t{@render children?.()}\n\t</button>\n{/if}\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "button/button.svelte"
		},
		{
			"content": "import Root, {\n\ttype ButtonProps,\n\ttype ButtonSize,\n\ttype ButtonShape,\n\ttype ButtonVariant,\n\tbuttonVariants,\n} from \"./button.svelte\";\n\nexport {\n\tRoot,\n\ttype ButtonProps as Props,\n\t//\n\tRoot as Button,\n\tbuttonVariants,\n\ttype ButtonProps,\n\ttype ButtonSize,\n\ttype ButtonShape,\n\ttype ButtonVariant,\n};\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "button/index.ts"
		}
	]
}